{"seq":1,"slug":"retention-lifecycle","title":"留存与生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/retention-lifecycle","wordCount":1120,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"留存与生命周期管理\">留存与生命周期管理</h1><p>日志数据不是存了就完事——它有明确的生命周期。一条 DEBUG 日志在 7 天后几乎没有价值，但一条审计日志可能需要保留 7 年。在 PB 级日志系统中，如果所有数据以相同的存储层级保留相同的时长，存储成本会迅速失控。生命周期管理的核心是：在正确的时间，将正确的数据，放在正确的存储层级上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>日志数据有明确的生命周期阶段：Hot（SSD, 高频查询）→ Warm（HDD/S3 Standard）→ Cold（S3 IA）→ Archive（Glacier）→ Delete。分层存储通过 TTL 规则自动迁移数据到更廉价的存储层级。差异化留存策略按日志类型设定不同保留期（DEBUG 3-7天 vs 审计日志 3-7年）。最优留存期由合规硬约束、预算上限和数据效用衰减三者共同决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日志生命周期阶段模型\">日志生命周期阶段模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    HOT[Hot 热层] --&gt;|&quot;7-14 天&quot;| WARM[Warm 温层]&#10;    WARM --&gt;|&quot;30-90 天&quot;| COLD[Cold 冷层]&#10;    COLD --&gt;|&quot;到期&quot;| DELETE[Delete 删除]&#10;    COLD --&gt;|&quot;合规要求&quot;| ARCHIVE[Archive 归档]&#10;&#10;    HOT -.-&gt;|NVMe SSD| PERF1[查询 &lt;100ms]&#10;    WARM -.-&gt;|HDD / S3 Standard| PERF2[查询 &lt;5s]&#10;    COLD -.-&gt;|S3 IA / Glacier IR| PERF3[查询 &lt;30s]&#10;    ARCHIVE -.-&gt;|S3 Glacier Deep| PERF4[恢复需数小时]\">graph LR\n    HOT[Hot 热层] --&gt;|\"7-14 天\"| WARM[Warm 温层]\n    WARM --&gt;|\"30-90 天\"| COLD[Cold 冷层]\n    COLD --&gt;|\"到期\"| DELETE[Delete 删除]\n    COLD --&gt;|\"合规要求\"| ARCHIVE[Archive 归档]\n\n    HOT -.-&gt;|NVMe SSD| PERF1[查询 &lt;100ms]\n    WARM -.-&gt;|HDD / S3 Standard| PERF2[查询 &lt;5s]\n    COLD -.-&gt;|S3 IA / Glacier IR| PERF3[查询 &lt;30s]\n    ARCHIVE -.-&gt;|S3 Glacier Deep| PERF4[恢复需数小时]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">阶段</th>\n<th>存储介质</th>\n<th align=\"center\">典型保留期</th>\n<th align=\"center\">查询延迟</th>\n<th align=\"center\">成本（相对）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Hot</td>\n<td>NVMe SSD / RAM</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3-14 天</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;100ms</td>\n<td align=\"center\">1.0x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Warm</td>\n<td>HDD / S3 Standard</td>\n<td align=\"center\">14-90 天</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;5s</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0.2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Cold</td>\n<td>S3 Infrequent Access</td>\n<td align=\"center\">90-365 天</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;30s</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0.05x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Archive</td>\n<td>S3 Glacier Deep</td>\n<td align=\"center\">1-7 年</td>\n<td align=\"center\">数小时</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0.01x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">Delete</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td align=\"center\">到期自动删除</td>\n<td align=\"center\">—</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层存储的实现\">分层存储的实现</h2><h3 id=\"clickhouse-ttl-volume-策略\">ClickHouse TTL + Volume 策略</h3><p>ClickHouse 原生支持基于 TTL 表达式的分层存储和自动删除：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE logs (&#10;    timestamp DateTime64(9, &#39;UTC&#39;),&#10;    service_name LowCardinality(String),&#10;    severity_number UInt8,&#10;    body String,&#10;    attributes Map(String, String)&#10;) ENGINE = MergeTree()&#10;PARTITION BY toDate(timestamp)&#10;ORDER BY (service_name, severity_number, timestamp)&#10;SETTINGS storage_policy = &#39;tiered&#39;&#10;TTL&#10;    toDate(timestamp) + INTERVAL 7 DAY TO VOLUME &#39;warm&#39;,&#10;    toDate(timestamp) + INTERVAL 30 DAY TO VOLUME &#39;cold&#39;,&#10;    toDate(timestamp) + INTERVAL 90 DAY DELETE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DateTime64(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UTC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LowCardinality(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    severity_number UInt8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attributes Map(String, String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MergeTree()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> toDate(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, severity_number, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SETTINGS storage_policy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tiered'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TTL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    toDate(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VOLUME </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    toDate(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VOLUME </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    toDate(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>storage_policy</code> 在 ClickHouse 配置中定义不同 Volume 对应的磁盘：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;storage_configuration&gt;&#10;  &lt;disks&gt;&#10;    &lt;hot&gt;&lt;path&gt;/data/hot/&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/hot&gt;&#10;    &lt;warm&gt;&lt;path&gt;/data/warm/&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/warm&gt;&#10;    &lt;cold&gt;&#10;      &lt;type&gt;s3&lt;/type&gt;&#10;      &lt;endpoint&gt;https://s3.amazonaws.com/logs-cold/&lt;/endpoint&gt;&#10;    &lt;/cold&gt;&#10;  &lt;/disks&gt;&#10;  &lt;policies&gt;&#10;    &lt;tiered&gt;&#10;      &lt;volumes&gt;&#10;        &lt;hot&gt;&lt;disk&gt;hot&lt;/disk&gt;&lt;/hot&gt;&#10;        &lt;warm&gt;&lt;disk&gt;warm&lt;/disk&gt;&lt;/warm&gt;&#10;        &lt;cold&gt;&lt;disk&gt;cold&lt;/disk&gt;&lt;/cold&gt;&#10;      &lt;/volumes&gt;&#10;    &lt;/tiered&gt;&#10;  &lt;/policies&gt;&#10;&lt;/storage_configuration&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">storage_configuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>/data/hot/&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">warm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>/data/warm/&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">warm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>s3&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>https://s3.amazonaws.com/logs-cold/&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">tiered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>hot&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">warm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>warm&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">warm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>cold&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">disk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">tiered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">storage_configuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"elasticsearch-ilm-index-lifecycle-management\">Elasticsearch ILM（Index Lifecycle Management）</h3><p>Elasticsearch 通过 ILM Policy 管理索引的生命周期：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;phases&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;hot&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;actions&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;rollover&quot;: { &quot;max_size&quot;: &quot;50GB&quot;, &quot;max_age&quot;: &quot;1d&quot; },&#10;          &quot;set_priority&quot;: { &quot;priority&quot;: 100 }&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;warm&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;min_age&quot;: &quot;7d&quot;,&#10;        &quot;actions&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;shrink&quot;: { &quot;number_of_shards&quot;: 1 },&#10;          &quot;forcemerge&quot;: { &quot;max_num_segments&quot;: 1 },&#10;          &quot;set_priority&quot;: { &quot;priority&quot;: 50 }&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;cold&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;min_age&quot;: &quot;30d&quot;,&#10;        &quot;actions&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;searchable_snapshot&quot;: { &quot;snapshot_repository&quot;: &quot;cold-repo&quot; }&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;delete&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;min_age&quot;: &quot;90d&quot;,&#10;        &quot;actions&quot;: { &quot;delete&quot;: {} }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"phases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"rollover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"50GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"set_priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"warm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"min_age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"shrink\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"number_of_shards\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"forcemerge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_num_segments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"set_priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"min_age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"searchable_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"snapshot_repository\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cold-repo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"delete\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"min_age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"90d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"delete\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {} }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"loki-的留存配置\">Loki 的留存配置</h3><p>Loki 通过 Compactor 组件执行留存策略，支持全局和 per-tenant 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"compactor:&#10;  retention_enabled: true&#10;  delete_request_store: s3&#10;limits_config:&#10;  retention_period: 720h # 全局 30 天&#10;  per_tenant_override_config: /etc/loki/overrides.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">compactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retention_enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  delete_request_store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">limits_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retention_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">720h</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 全局 30 天</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  per_tenant_override_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/etc/loki/overrides.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"差异化留存策略设计\">差异化留存策略设计</h2><p>一刀切的留存期是浪费和风险并存的。正确的做法是按日志类型设定不同的保留期：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>日志类型</th>\n<th align=\"center\">留存期</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n<th>存储层路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DEBUG/TRACE</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3-7 天</td>\n<td>仅调试用，快速老化</td>\n<td>Hot → Delete</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用 INFO</td>\n<td align=\"center\">14-30 天</td>\n<td>覆盖一个 sprint 周期</td>\n<td>Hot → Warm → Delete</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ERROR/WARN</td>\n<td align=\"center\">30-90 天</td>\n<td>复盘和趋势分析</td>\n<td>Hot → Warm → Cold → Delete</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全审计日志</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3-7 年</td>\n<td>合规要求（SOX/GDPR/等保）</td>\n<td>Hot → Warm → Cold → Archive</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问日志</td>\n<td align=\"center\">30-90 天</td>\n<td>安全取证和用户行为分析</td>\n<td>Hot → Warm → Cold → Delete</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"按级别路由到不同保留策略\">按级别路由到不同保留策略</h3><p>在 OTel Collector 或 Loki 中实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# OTel Collector: 按级别路由到不同 pipeline&#10;processors:&#10;  routing:&#10;    from_attribute: severity_text&#10;    table:&#10;      - value: DEBUG&#10;        pipelines: [logs/short_retention]&#10;      - value: INFO&#10;        pipelines: [logs/medium_retention]&#10;      - value: ERROR&#10;        pipelines: [logs/long_retention]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># OTel Collector: 按级别路由到不同 pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  routing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    from_attribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">severity_text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DEBUG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">logs/short_retention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INFO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">logs/medium_retention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ERROR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">logs/long_retention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"留存策略的量化决策框架\">留存策略的量化决策框架</h2><p>确定每类日志的留存期需要平衡三个因素：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OptimalRetention</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Compliance</mtext><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Budget</mtext><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>Utility</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OptimalRetention} = \\max(\\text{Compliance}_{min}, \\min(\\text{Budget}_{max}, \\text{Utility}_{threshold}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OptimalRetention</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Compliance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Budget</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Utility</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>Compliance<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4617em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：法规/合同要求的最短保留期（硬约束，不可违反）</li>\n<li><strong>Budget<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3014em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：预算允许的最长保留期</li>\n<li><strong>Utility<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_{threshold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4861em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：日志在多久后失去排障价值——可通过分析&quot;被查询的日志中，有多少比例的日期距离超过 N 天&quot;来量化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实际操作中，运行一个查询统计不同年龄日志的被查询频率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- ClickHouse: 分析哪些日期的日志还在被查询&#10;SELECT&#10;    dateDiff(&#39;day&#39;, log_timestamp, query_timestamp) AS age_days,&#10;    count() AS query_count&#10;FROM query_audit_log&#10;GROUP BY age_days&#10;ORDER BY age_days;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ClickHouse: 分析哪些日期的日志还在被查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    dateDiff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, log_timestamp, query_timestamp) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_audit_log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果发现 95% 的查询只涉及最近 14 天的数据，那么 14 天之外的 INFO 日志保留价值极低——可以安全删除或转入极冷存储。</p>\n<h2 id=\"删除与合规的冲突处理\">删除与合规的冲突处理</h2><p>GDPR &quot;被遗忘权&quot;要求：当用户请求删除其个人数据时，你需要从日志中清除包含其 PII 的记录。这与日志的 append-only 存储模型存在根本冲突。</p>\n<p>解决方案矩阵：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th align=\"center\">成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源头脱敏</td>\n<td>写入前脱敏 PII</td>\n<td align=\"center\">低</td>\n<td>最优——从源头消除问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密密钥轮转</td>\n<td>PII 字段加密，删除时销毁密钥</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中</td>\n<td>需保留 PII 但可能需删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志重写</td>\n<td>事后扫描并重写匹配记录</td>\n<td align=\"center\">高</td>\n<td>遗留系统，无法改源头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短留存期</td>\n<td>PII 相关日志保留期 &lt; 合规窗口</td>\n<td align=\"center\">低</td>\n<td>满足时效性要求即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>与<a href=\"compliance-audit-trail\">合规与审计追踪</a>的关系：留存策略是合规要求的执行层——合规定义了&quot;必须保留多久&quot;和&quot;必须能删除什么&quot;，本文讨论的是&quot;如何工程化地实现这些要求&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生命周期管理是日志系统成本控制的核心机制。ClickHouse TTL + Volume、ES ILM、Loki Compactor retention 是三大后端各自的实现路径。关键决策：按日志类型差异化留存（而非一刀切）、通过查询频率分析量化数据效用衰减、GDPR 删除义务通过源头脱敏或加密密钥轮转解决（而非事后扫描重写）。分层存储将热数据存储成本降低 20-100 倍。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"留存与生命周期管理","id":"留存与生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"日志生命周期阶段模型","id":"日志生命周期阶段模型"},{"level":2,"text":"分层存储的实现","id":"分层存储的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"ClickHouse TTL + Volume 策略","id":"clickhouse-ttl-volume-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Elasticsearch ILM（Index Lifecycle Management）","id":"elasticsearch-ilm-index-lifecycle-management"},{"level":3,"text":"Loki 的留存配置","id":"loki-的留存配置"},{"level":2,"text":"差异化留存策略设计","id":"差异化留存策略设计"},{"level":3,"text":"按级别路由到不同保留策略","id":"按级别路由到不同保留策略"},{"level":2,"text":"留存策略的量化决策框架","id":"留存策略的量化决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"删除与合规的冲突处理","id":"删除与合规的冲突处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"日志分析与异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-analytics-ml"},"next":{"title":"合规与审计追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/compliance-audit-trail"}}